# a tight loop and produced 13.8 MB of identical errors. The failure is understood (wrong
# Acacia allocation, see the Acacia note) and the file would otherwise need a history
# rewrite to remove. Kept on disk on Setonix, out of git.
03_kraken/slurm/logs/acacia_dbv3_49970753.err
